  "portal_description": "Red Hat Ansible Inside enables Red Hat Partners to embed the power of Ansible automation inside of their application(s).  Red Hat Partners embedding Ansible Inside benefit from the scaleability and extensible eco system of Ansible Automation, this allows the partner to invest in their application and leave the integrations and automations to Ansible. Ansible Inside provides the ability to execute Ansible directly from within the Partner application.",
